<title>USA: Microchip Technology files for stock sale.</title>
<headline>Microchip Technology files for stock sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHANDLER, Ariz. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microchip Technology Inc on Monday said it has registered to sell 1.0 million common shares in a public offering.</p>
<p>All shares are being sold by the company.  The offering is being made by Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Prudential Securities Inc, and Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co LLC.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used primarily for debt reduction, working capital and other corporate purposes.</p>
